Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${php:Depends},
         libllama0
Description: PHP extension for local GGUF embeddings
 LlamaEmbed loads a GGUF model through libllama and returns
 L2-normalized embedding vectors.
 .
 The package is built against every PHP version in the distro
 (phpquery -V) and registers the llama module with phpenmod for
 every SAPI of those versions (cli, fpm, apache2, and the rest).
 A SAPI installed later picks the module up from that registry.
